@startuml
|Administrator|
start
:Select create, role or activation change;
|Web UI / API|
:Send request;
|Application Service|
:Check administrator and validate user data;
if (Valid and authorized?) then (yes)
  |Repository / Database|
  :Begin transaction;
  :Save user change; revoke sessions if inactive; audit;
  :Commit;
  |Web UI / API|
  :Show success;
else (no)
  |Web UI / API|
  :Show validation, conflict or permission error;
endif
stop
@enduml
